
function register_block_spec taking block_text as text and block_name as text and block_id as number and texture_src as text returning void
    display text Block registration specification end text
    display block_text
    display block_name
    display block_id
    display texture_src

    if block_id is less than 198 or block_id is greater than 4098
        display text ERROR: block ID must be between 198 and 4098 inclusive end text
    otherwise
        display text Client registration: create a rock block, set hardness and gravel step sound, assign its unlocalized name and creative tab, then register its item and renderer end text
        display text Server registration: create the same block during bootstrap, register it, then rebuild block-state IDs from every valid state and metadata value end text
        display text After registration, rebuild BLOCK_STATE_IDS using (registered block ID shifted left 4) bitwise OR metadata end text
        display text On AsyncSink load, register the block renderer again after resource reload end text
        display text Add the block localization entry: tile.<block_name>.name = <block_text> end text
        display text Write block/cube_all model JSON using blocks/<block_name> as the all texture end text
        display text Write the item model JSON with parent block/<block_name> and the original third-person transform end text
        display text Write blockstates/<block_name>.json with the normal variant pointing at model <block_name> end text
        display text Fetch texture_src and write its bytes to textures/blocks/<block_name>.png end text
    end if

    display text Manual port required: customFunction(block) is arbitrary JavaScript and must be rewritten against a real EaglerForge bridge end text
    display text Manual port required: ModAPI reflection, event listeners, AsyncSink, fetch, JSON serialization, and dedicated-server code generation have no Zelix runtime bindings end text
end function

call register_block_spec with text Block of netherite end text and text netheriteBlock end text and 198 and text https://assets.mcasset.cloud/1.21.3/assets/minecraft/textures/block/netherite_block.png end text
